    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56182" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατώτερος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Comp.
		
		Adj. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lower</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				9.17
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. μέρη τῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			; <i>more southerly</i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				34.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time,
				<i>later, younger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				131
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωτέρω</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω</span>
			.</div>
